Manifest-Version: 1.0
AutoUpdate-Show-In-Client: true
AutoUpdate-Essential-Module: false
OpenIDE-Module-Java-Dependencies: Java > 21
OpenIDE-Module-Layer: layer.xml
OpenIDE-Module-Display-Category: SNAP Community Plugins
OpenIDE-Module-Long-Description: The EOMasters Toolbox for SNAP provides tools, readers, processors, and workflow enhancements for Earth observation work.<br>
 Among other things:
 <ul>
 <li>Quick Menu</li>
 <li>Loop GPT</li>
 <li>Band Maths Extensions</li>
 <li>Wavelength Editor</li>
 <li>Asset Library</li>
 <li>SpeX spectral index database</li>
 <li>PyEditor and SnapKit</li>
 <li>Coastal Map and Cyanobacteria Index processors</li>
 <li>Sentinel-2 geometry, normalisation, and super-resolution processors</li>
 <li>ASTER and EMIT readers</li>
 <li>Generate System Report</li>
 </ul>
 <p>
 <b>Vendor: </b>EOMasters<br>
 <b>Web: </b><a href="https://www.eomasters.org">www.eomasters.org</a><br>
 <b>Contact Address: </b> <a href="mailto:info@eomasters.org">info@eomasters.org</a><br>
